# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
# 注意：不要写成 /node_modules —— 带前导斜杠只锚定仓库根目录，
# 匹配不到 packages/*/node_modules，会把嵌套的依赖目录提交进仓库。
node_modules/
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build
/docs
# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# cursor
.cursor/
/lib/generated/prisma

# Windsurf
.windsurf
.claude
.augment
.kiro
.pnpm-store
.test-data
public/generated/

# AI 生成图片的落盘目录（docker-compose 把它挂到容器的 /app/public/generated）
# 生成物不入库：会被 .env 的 IMAGE_STORAGE_DIR 指向，且体积极大
/generated/